Description:
Nothing makes us happier than seeing how you style our pieces in your homes 🏡 Here's a roundup of some of our favourite tags recently:

@athomewithmollie_ Lomax sofa and footstool
@ashfield.house Cheviot table, Wyre bench and Brockwell chair
@amelia_home_edit Lavinia sofa
@house.no71 Connie armchair
@skipsatthesanderson Fuji dining table
@chez_shay Hoxton sofa

Is your house a Barker and Stonehouse? Tag us in your home pics for a chance to be featured on our page! 📸
